{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eletar Hero 2 is a fast, skill-based action platformer built around speed, precision, and powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three heroes chosen by the Eletar, each with their own movement style and combat powers. Race through dangerous, trap-filled levels, outplay intense bosses, and use overpowered abilities to bend the rules of the game in your favour - if you're skilled enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique heroes, each with their own movement and combat style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based platforming design for speedrunning and mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pattern-driven boss fights that reward timing and skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful elemental abilities that let you break through enemies and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels that twist the rules, including reversed controls and tight, high-pressure spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden upgrades and secrets for players who explore and experiment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards to compete for the highest score</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925020?t=1768437652","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925020/c9700bbabad8e8f2906546c60a76cee13dbdfb37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768437652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925020/40139176fe4a54597d149f9b38d7d2464c8a74a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768437652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925020/40139176fe4a54597d149f9b38d7d2464c8a74a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768437652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","i